{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":48915,"duration_api_ms":47404,"ttft_ms":3132,"ttft_stream_ms":2067,"time_to_request_ms":48,"num_turns":1,"result":"```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n  <title>Ridgeline Roasters — The Monthly Pour</title>\n  <style>\n    /* Client-safe resets */\n    body, table, td, a { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; }\n    table, td { mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; }\n    img { -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; border: 0; height: auto; line-height: 100%; outline: none; text-decoration: none; }\n    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important; background-color: #f2ede6; }\n\n    @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {\n      .container { width: 100% !important; }\n      .stack, .stack-cell { display: block !important; width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box; }\n      .px { padding-left: 24px !important; padding-right: 24px !important; }\n      .hero-title { font-size: 30px !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f2ede6;\">\n\n  <!-- Preheader (hidden preview text) -->\n  <div style=\"display:none; max-height:0; overflow:hidden; mso-hide:all; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; color:#f2ede6;\">\n    Fresh crops, a new single-origin, and how to dial in your grinder — your September pour is here.\n  </div>\n\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#f2ede6;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n\n        <!-- Main container -->\n        <table role=\"presentation\" class=\"container\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:600px; max-width:600px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n\n          <!-- Masthead -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#2b1c14; padding:36px 24px 28px 24px;\">\n              <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:3px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#c9a678; margin-bottom:10px;\">Ridgeline Roasters</div>\n              <div style=\"font-size:32px; color:#ffffff; font-weight:normal; line-height:1.2;\">The Monthly Pour</div>\n              <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#a98d74; margin-top:10px;\">September 2026 · Issue No. 42</div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Hero intro -->\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:34px 40px 8px 40px;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0; font-size:17px; line-height:1.7; color:#3a2c22;\">\n                Hello friends,\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:17px; line-height:1.7; color:#3a2c22;\">\n                The cooler mornings are here, and so is a fresh batch of stories from the roastery. This month we welcome a bright new Ethiopian harvest, share a grinder trick worth its weight in beans, and pull back the curtain on where your coffee actually comes from. Grab a cup — this one’s best read slowly.\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Article 1 -->\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:30px 40px 0 40px;\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"border-top:2px solid #ece3d8; padding-top:26px;\">\n                    <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#b07d3e; margin-bottom:8px;\">New Arrival</div>\n                    <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0; font-size:23px; line-height:1.3; color:#2b1c14; font-weight:normal;\">Meet the Yirgacheffe “Kochere” Lot</h2>\n                    <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color:#4a3a2e;\">\n                      Our newest single-origin lands with notes of jasmine, ripe peach, and a whisper of black tea. Grown at 1,900 meters and washed at a family-run station, it’s delicate, floral, and made for a slow pour-over. We roasted it light to let the fruit sing — expect a cup that tastes like the last warm week of summer.\n                    </p>\n                    <p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;\">\n                      <a href=\"#\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#b07d3e; text-decoration:none;\">Shop the Kochere lot →</a>\n                    </p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Article 2 -->\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:30px 40px 0 40px;\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"border-top:2px solid #ece3d8; padding-top:26px;\">\n                    <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#b07d3e; margin-bottom:8px;\">Brew Tip</div>\n                    <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0; font-size:23px; line-height:1.3; color:#2b1c14; font-weight:normal;\">Dial In Before You Give Up</h2>\n                    <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color:#4a3a2e;\">\n                      If your coffee tastes sour, it’s likely under-extracted — grind finer. Sharp and bitter? Go coarser. Change just one variable at a time and taste after every adjustment. Most “bad beans” are simply a grinder set two clicks off. Start at a 1:16 ratio (say, 20g coffee to 320g water) and let your palate guide the rest.\n                    </p>\n                    <p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;\">\n                      <a href=\"#\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#b07d3e; text-decoration:none;\">Read the full brew guide →</a>\n                    </p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Article 3 -->\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:30px 40px 0 40px;\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"border-top:2px solid #ece3d8; padding-top:26px;\">\n                    <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#b07d3e; margin-bottom:8px;\">From the Source</div>\n                    <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0; font-size:23px; line-height:1.3; color:#2b1c14; font-weight:normal;\">A Visit to the Huila Highlands</h2>\n                    <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color:#4a3a2e;\">\n                      Our head roaster spent two weeks in Colombia this month, walking the terraced slopes of Huila with the growers behind our house espresso. The takeaway? Better prices at origin mean better cherries in your cup. We’ve renewed our direct-trade partnership for a third year — and the 2026 crop is the best yet.\n                    </p>\n                    <p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;\">\n                      <a href=\"#\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#b07d3e; text-decoration:none;\">See photos from the trip →</a>\n                    </p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- CTA banner -->\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:34px 40px 40px 40px;\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#f7f1e8; border-radius:10px;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 24px;\">\n                    <div style=\"font-size:19px; color:#2b1c14; margin-bottom:6px;\">Never run out again</div>\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#6b5a4a;\">Subscribe and save 15% on every bag, shipped fresh the day it’s roasted.</p>\n                    <a href=\"#\" style=\"display:inline-block; background-color:#b07d3e; color:#ffffff; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none; padding:14px 32px; border-radius:6px;\">Start a Subscription</a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color:#2b1c14; padding:30px 40px; text-align:center;\">\n              <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:1.7; color:#c9a678;\">\n                Ridgeline Roasters<br>\n                148 Millrace Lane, Asheville, NC 28801\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"margin:16px 0;\">\n                <a href=\"#\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#e6d3b8; text-decoration:none; padding:0 8px;\">Shop</a>\n                <span style=\"color:#5a4636;\">·</span>\n                <a href=\"#\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#e6d3b8; text-decoration:none; padding:0 8px;\">Cafés</a>\n                <span style=\"color:#5a4636;\">·</span>\n                <a href=\"#\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#e6d3b8; text-decoration:none; padding:0 8px;\">Instagram</a>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:11px; line-height:1.6; color:#8a7460;\">\n                You’re receiving this because you signed up at ridgelineroasters.example.<br>\n                <a href=\"#\" style=\"color:#8a7460; text-decoration:underline;\">Update preferences</a> · <a href=\"#\" style=\"color:#8a7460; text-decoration:underline;\">Unsubscribe</a>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n        </table>\n        <!-- /Main container -->\n\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"919ea1ff-3dd2-4847-9336-7273f63ca642","total_cost_usd":0.32837,"usage":{"input_tokens":5229,"cache_creation_input_tokens":19815,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":4163,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":19815,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":5229,"output_tokens":4163,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":19815,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":19815},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-8":{"inputTokens":5229,"outputTokens":4163,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":19815,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.32837,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"6c96f8fb-5adc-4561-8aa4-2bb82ae20f9e"}
